WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.378 --> 00:00:04.379
We made it.

00:00:06.214 --> 00:00:10.176
I'm Fujita, I work for Mr. En.
Nice to meet you.

00:00:10.301 --> 00:00:11.970
Huh? Uh, yeah.

00:00:12.053 --> 00:00:14.806
Her boob is sticking out. Is that right?

00:00:14.848 --> 00:00:16.599
I'm Fujita, nice to meet you.

00:00:16.683 --> 00:00:18.143
Is that in right now?

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:22.063
Thank you for waiting.
Please come this way.

00:00:22.147 --> 00:00:23.982
I will take your masks and coats.

00:00:24.482 --> 00:00:26.568
I didn't need to fix it, then.

00:00:26.651 --> 00:00:27.986
Sorry, senpai.

00:00:34.617 --> 00:00:36.411
See, I told you I dressed nicely.

00:00:41.833 --> 00:00:43.418
She's a girl?

00:00:45.336 --> 00:00:46.337
You're late.

00:00:46.838 --> 00:00:48.173
Ah, cut the crap.

00:00:49.174 --> 00:00:50.633
Here is your aperitif.

00:00:50.717 --> 00:00:53.428
It's been a while, Noi. How have you been?

00:00:54.095 --> 00:00:55.180
What's this?

00:00:55.263 --> 00:00:56.848
It's a Kir Martini.

00:00:57.348 --> 00:00:59.184
Don't ignore your cousin.

00:00:59.601 --> 00:01:00.560
You're cousins?

00:01:01.269 --> 00:01:03.438
Is Noi being helpful, Shin?

00:01:03.897 --> 00:01:05.857
I am, aren't I?

00:01:05.940 --> 00:01:08.610
Braised? What does that mean?

00:01:11.112 --> 00:01:14.115
So, about your new assignment.

00:01:14.574 --> 00:01:19.412
En, I don't want to deal with any more
assignments with multiple targets.

00:01:19.871 --> 00:01:24.876
It's messy and I'm fed up
with having to kill lots of weak guys.

00:01:25.376 --> 00:01:28.046
Don't worry.
Your next target is just a team of two.

00:01:28.713 --> 00:01:30.381
I hear they're pretty tough, too.

00:01:30.882 --> 00:01:31.883
Right, Fujita?

00:01:31.966 --> 00:01:35.887
Huh? You mean these two
are going to kill that lizard guy?

00:01:36.679 --> 00:01:38.264
Is he strong?

00:01:38.723 --> 00:01:40.058
Magic doesn't work on him,

00:01:40.141 --> 00:01:42.268
so you must kill him with your bare hands.

00:01:42.393 --> 00:01:43.561
With my bare hands...

00:01:44.104 --> 00:01:45.105
Senpai!

00:01:46.064 --> 00:01:46.898
I'm in.

00:01:47.482 --> 00:01:50.276
Hey, put that back, Ebisu! Stop!

00:01:51.402 --> 00:01:55.698
Noi, I want you to fix Ebisu.

00:01:56.407 --> 00:01:59.744
I'm interested in who cast the spell
on the lizard guy.

00:02:00.245 --> 00:02:03.790
Ebisu uses lizard Magic,
so she might know something.

00:02:03.915 --> 00:02:08.086
Senpai, let's have a kilo of steak!
It's En's restaurant anyways.

00:02:10.088 --> 00:02:14.425
Let me tell you about the lizard guy
and his female friend.

00:02:18.096 --> 00:02:19.806
Welcome.

00:02:20.431 --> 00:02:23.434
Sit back, relax,
and enjoy our transformation show.

00:02:25.019 --> 00:02:26.855
-Aitake.
-And Maitake.

00:02:26.938 --> 00:02:27.814
Nice to meet you.

00:02:28.523 --> 00:02:30.942
Shape-shifting Sorcerers, huh?

00:02:31.484 --> 00:02:33.486
Must be hard work, too.

00:02:33.611 --> 00:02:37.157
Wow, they can turn into celebrities
and stuff, right?

00:02:37.448 --> 00:02:39.742
Transforming!

00:02:43.454 --> 00:02:44.289
Looks weak.

00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:47.750
Do I look like him?

00:02:48.501 --> 00:02:52.380
Hey, can we have a drink too?

00:02:53.548 --> 00:02:55.758
Were you the one
that picked up my call today?

00:02:55.842 --> 00:02:58.887
Yes. Did you like your calf's liver?

00:02:59.304 --> 00:03:02.390
I only eat mushrooms, you fakes.

00:03:03.016 --> 00:03:05.476
It's too late now!

00:03:06.352 --> 00:03:09.314
You doofus, getting tricked like that!

00:03:09.355 --> 00:03:12.066
Why did you use a fork?
Use a knife, for Christ's sake.

00:03:12.567 --> 00:03:16.196
Don't get me wrong, Noi.
I was just having a little fun.

00:03:16.321 --> 00:03:17.572
-Damn it.
-Run!

00:03:18.406 --> 00:03:19.324
Fools.

00:03:27.165 --> 00:03:30.668
Find the real Aitake and Maitake.
They should be somewhere.

00:03:31.502 --> 00:03:35.089
If they're dead,
use their bodies to grow mushrooms.

00:03:35.590 --> 00:03:37.675
Cook these as usual.

00:03:37.717 --> 00:03:40.678
What?
You mean the mushrooms we just ate...

00:03:43.932 --> 00:03:46.726
I hate wasting good mushrooms.

